{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24786","headline":"七老会诗 · 胡杲","name":"七老会诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲居同会在三春，大抵愚年最出羣。\n霜鬓不嫌杯酒兴，白头仍爱玉炉熏。\n裴回玩柳心犹健，老大看花意却勤。\n凿落满斟判酩酊，香囊高挂任氤氲。\n搜神得句题红叶，望景长吟对白云。\n今日交情何不替？齐年同事圣明君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡杲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}